  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/Imgs/logo.png\" width=\"625\" height=\"195\"></div><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/Imgs/strip.png\" width=\"900\"></p><h3>Этот мод добавляет деревянные инструменты для каждого вида древесины!</h3><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Ель</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/spruce_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Берёза</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/birch_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Джунгли</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/jungle_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Акация</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/acacia_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Тёмный дуб</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/dark_oak_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Мангровый дерево</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/mangrove_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Вишня</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/cherry_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Бамбук</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/bamboo_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Карминовый</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/crimson_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>Искривлённый</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/src/main/resources/assets/woodentoolvariants/textures/item/warped_pickaxe.png\" width=\"60\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h4>Отличный дополнительный мод для <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-crafting-tables-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Crafting Tables</a> и <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmore-chest-variants-lieonlion\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Chest Variants</a></h4><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/Quad/main/requireQuad.png\" width=\"190\"></a></h3><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1/fabric/Imgs/strip.png\" width=\"900\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/SniffBakaSniff/Wooden-Tool-Variants-1.20.1\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=ff0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Subaka_\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:none\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=ff0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\"> </a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/